<title>UK: Commerzbank sets 2.0 bln Lux franc Jan 2004 bond.</title>
<headline>Commerzbank sets 2.0 bln Lux franc Jan 2004 bond.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-11-15</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond was announced by lead manager Kredietbank.</p>
<p> BORROWER   COMMERZBANK AG</p>
<p> AMT    2.0 BLN LUF   COUPON     5.50	MATURITY    10.JAN.04</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  102.625   PAY DATE  9/10.JAN.97</p>
<p> FULL FEES  1.875     REOFFER    =	   YIELD	 5.05</p>
<p> MOODY	AA2	 LISTING    LUX	 GOV LAW     LUX</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  AA-	 DENOMS (K) 50-250    PRAECIP     0.25</p>
<p> NEG PLG    NO	  CRS DEFLT  NO	  FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> NOTES	ISSUED OFF AN EMTN PROGRAMME.</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
